  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "水環境管理與污染防治",
    "sub_ename": "AQUA-ENVIRONMENT MANAGEMENT AND POLLUTION CONTROL",
    "describe_ch": "本課程之目標在指導學生了解水環境之品質惡化成因及探討最佳可行方案，學習過程著重於污染預防與環境管理之規劃，課程中將以實際案例之診斷分析及整治方法之檢討評估，培養學生對各類型水環境之規畫管理與解決問題之執行能力。",
    "describe_eh": "The goals of this course are to guide students in understanding the origin of the aqua-environment quality deterioration and to survey the optimized solutions. The learning process focuses on the planning of pollution prevention and environmental management. Diagnostic analysis and remediation methods evaluation will be applied to case studies. To develop students' ability to manage and solve problems in various types of aqua-environments.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "具備各類水環境物化原理之知識\t",
      "describe_en": "Knowledge of the basic physical-chemical principles in various aqua-environments"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "理解水環境之污染問題成因及相關整治技術\t",
      "describe_en": "To comprehension the origin of pollution problems and the corresponding remediation techniques in aqua-environment"
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "分析個案之能力\t",
      "describe_en": "To analysis the real case"
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "評估整治方法之應用",
      "describe_en": "Evaluation of the application of remediation methods"
    }
  ],
